<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 153,983.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 153,983.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of February 18 totaled 153,983 bales, up from 144,155 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 12,735 bales issued, no decertification orders, 2,907 cancellations, and 12,719 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
